      "comment": "AUSSIE SUPREME (4) struggled in tougher grade last start after settling off pace at this track, but prior to that won by one length at this track (19.88) beating Big Duke in a Grade 5 on July 24. Has winning claims on his best figures. BRAVADO (2) has missed the frame at his last couple but wasn't beaten far three back when second (17.06) at this track in a Special conditions Veteran race. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. SKEETER MIKADO (1) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 7th at this track following on from a third place finish (20.08) there the start prior. Deserves plenty of respect. PAW OLIVE (8) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
